<title>USA: Jamaica seeks 3,000 tonnes PL-480 Rice - agent.</title>
<headline>Jamaica seeks 3,000 tonnes PL-480 Rice - agent.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jamaica was tendering for about 3,000 tonnes of U.S. rice in bulk under the PL-480 donation program, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>The delivery date was set for May 20-June 5.</p>
<p>The rice was U.S. no. 5 or better long grain brown rice for processing with maximum brokens 10 percent.</p>
<p>Offer must be received no later than May 8.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
